Note on statutory texts

The texts of the Civil Code of the People's Republic of China and related
judicial interpretations reproduced under references/民法典/ and
references/司法解释/ are official documents. Under Article 5 of the Copyright
Law of the People's Republic of China, laws, regulations, resolutions,
decisions and orders of state organs, and other documents of a legislative,
administrative or judicial nature are not subject to copyright. No rights are
claimed over them, and this license does not purport to grant any.
